cheese, and with lots of vegetables, what you have is bread,
vegetables and sauce, which is actually a good meal. I find it to be
rather tasty. A number of good restaurants in New York like
Mezzogiorno actually serve small pizzas this way (that is, without
cheese) just because it tastes good and not because they have any
particular desire to cater to vegans.

